   "cue": "s1",
   "text": "Imagine you find a strange machine in your room.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.92,
   "end": 6.18,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "It has one button.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.08,
   "end": 8.58,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "And one word on it.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.48,
   "end": 10.54,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Clone.",
   "scene": "s1"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.54,
   "end": 11.48,
   "cue": "s2",
   "text": "You press it.",
   "scene": "s2"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.18,
   "end": 15.48,
   "cue": "s3",
   "text": "And suddenly, there are two of you.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.38,
   "end": 17.64,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Same face.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.24,
   "end": 19.1,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Same hoodie.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.7,
   "end": 20.84,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Same everything.",
   "scene": "s3"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.54,
   "end": 24.56,
   "cue": "s4",
   "text": "At first, it's amazing.",
   "scene": "s4"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.46,
   "end": 29.4,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Your clone cleans your room, while you play games all day.",
   "scene": "s4"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.4,
   "end": 31.5,
   "cue": "s5",
   "text": "It even goes to school for you.",
   "scene": "s5"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.4,
   "end": 34.94,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "And it gets better grades than you ever did.",
   "scene": "s5"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.94,
   "end": 36.6,
   "cue": "s6",
   "text": "Your teacher loves it.",
   "scene": "s6"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.5,
   "end": 38.72,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "Your friends love it.",
   "scene": "s6"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.42,
   "end": 42.96,
   "cue": "s7",
   "text": "But one night, the clone comes home\u2026",
   "scene": "s7"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.86,
   "end": 45.88,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "and it doesn't go back in the machine.",
   "scene": "s7"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.88,
   "end": 47.54,
   "cue": "s8",
   "text": "It sleeps in your bed.",
   "scene": "s8"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.44,
   "end": 49.82,
   "cue": "",
   "text": "It takes your room.",
   "scene": "s8"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.82,
   "end": 52.2,
   "cue": "s9",
   "text": "The next morning, your mom calls your name\u2026",
   "scene": "s9"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.1,
